COMPILATION OF: E46N21

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

  12 c        put file(outf) line(2) list('A');
SYNTAX                        ?
    1 ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N21

   1 a 0000 E46N21:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] NEGATIVE: FILE LINE.  `ctl_keys' is
   4 a 0006      SKIP/PAGE/LINE (parser.ml:134), so LINE parses as a
   5 a 0006      control item and `file_items' refuses it by class and
   6 a 0006      position.  Nothing of mine, and nothing in the corpus,
   7 a 0006      measures what DR emits for it behind a stream-output
   8 a 0006      attach -- COPYLPT's LINE uses are GET, not PUT, and
   9 a 0006      are on a printer file. */
  10 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  11 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N21OUT DAT');
  12 c 0023   put file(outf) line(2) list('A');
  13 c 003D   close file(outf);
  14 a 003D end E46N21;

CODE SIZE = 0040
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 389A
END  COMPILATION
